trance Renovation', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, JULY 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALREADY ONE OF THE MOST ICONIC RESORTS IN THE WORLD, CAESARS PALACE IS NOT RESTING ON ITS LAURELS. INSTEAD, IT EMBARKS ON A MULTIMILLION-DOLLAR RENOVATION OF THE ORIGINAL MAIN ENTRANCE, MAIN CASINO AND PORTE-COCHÈRE TO CREATE AN EXTRAVAGANT ENTRYWAY, REDESIGNED GAMING AREAS AND A NEW LOBBY BAR.'}{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2021-07-07 17:49:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cboe Global Markets Reports June 2021 Trading Volume', 'text': 'CHICAGO, JULY 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS, INC. (CBOE: CBOE),\xa0A LEADING PROVIDER OF GLOBAL MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE AND TRADABLE PRODUCTS, TODAY REPORTED JUNE MONTHLY TRADING VOLUME STATISTICS ACROSS ITS GLOBAL BUSINESS LINES, AND PROVIDED GUIDANCE FOR SELECTED REVENUE PER CONTRACT/NET REVENUE CAPTURE METRICS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021. THE DATA SHEET "CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS MONTHLY VOLUME & RPC/NET REVENUE CAPTURE REPORT" CONTAINS AN OVERVIEW OF CERTAIN JUNE TRADING STATISTICS AND MARKET SHARE BY BUSINESS SEGMENT, VOLUME IN SELECT INDEX PRODUCTS, AND RPC/NET CAPTURE, WHICH IS REPORTED ON A ONE-MONTH LAG, ACROSS BUSINESS LINES.'}{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2021-07-07 11:31:00-04:56', 'title': 'Chubb Survey Finds Consumer Behaviors Toward Cyber Security Remain Unchanged Despite Increasing Risk', 'text': "WHITEHOUSE STATION, N.J., JULY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- A NEW STUDY FROM CHUBB FINDS THAT WHEN IT COMES TO CYBERSECURITY, AMERICANS' ACTIONS HAVE NOT YET CAUGHT UP TO THE INCREASING CYBER RISKS RESULTING FROM SIGNIFICANT CHANGES TO OUR WORK, ACTIVITIES, AND DAILY HABITS BROUGHT ABOUT BY THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC."}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2021-07-07 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hollands Kroon Enables Work from Anywhere with Citrix® and RawWorks', 'text': 'FORT LAUDERDALE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CITRIXWORKSPACE--WORK USED TO BE A PLACE PEOPLE WENT. TODAY, IT HAPPENS EVERYWHERE – AT HOMES, IN OFFICES AND ON THE GO. TO SUCCEED, PEOPLE NEED THE SPACE AND TOOLS TO THINK, CREATE AND EXPLORE, WHEREVER THEY HAPPEN TO BE. HOLLANDS KROON UNDERSTANDS THIS. AND WITH THE HELP OF CITRIX 2021 PARTNER INNOVATION AWARD WINNER RAWWORKS, THE NETHERLANDS MUNICIPALITY HAS IMPLEMENTED DIGITAL WORKSPACE SOLUTIONS FROM CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. (NASDAQ: CTXS) TO DELIVER A MODERN WORKPLACE E'}{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2021-07-07 10:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'CSX Announces Date for Second-Quarter Earnings Release', 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA., JULY 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CSX CORP. (NASDAQ: CSX) WILL RELEASE SECOND-QUARTER FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS AFTER THE MARKET CLOSE ON WEDNESDAY, JULY 21, 2021. THIS WILL BE FOLLOWED BY A CONFERENCE CALL AND LIVE WEBCAST HOSTED BY THE COMPANY'S MANAGEMENT TEAM AT 4:30 P.M. EASTERN TIME."}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2021-07-07 12:44:00-04:56', 'title': 'CVS Health Corporation Announces Quarterly Dividend', 'text': 'WOONSOCKET, R.I., JULY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CVS HEALTH CORPORATION (NYSE: CVS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF FIFTY CENTS ($0.50) PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE CORPORATION.'}{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2021-07-07 07:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA to Host Second Quarter 2021 Conference Call on August 5th', 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., JULY 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (“DENTSPLY SIRONA”) (NASDAQ: XRAY), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY WILL BE HOSTING AN INVESTOR CONFERENCE CALL AND LIVE WEBCAST ON THURSDAY, AUGUST 5, 2021 AT 8:30 AM ET TO REVIEW ITS FINANCIAL RESULTS. A PRESENTATION RELATED TO THE CALL WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE INVESTORS SECTION OF THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AT HTTPS://INVESTOR.DENTSPLYSIRONA.COM."}{'symbol': 'DLR', 'date': '2021-07-07 06:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Digital Realty Recognized as Leader in IDC MarketScape for Datacenter, Colocation and Interconnection Services for Second Consecutive Year', 'text': "AUSTIN, TEXAS, JULY 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DIGITAL REALTY (NYSE: DLR), THE LARGEST GLOBAL PRO